    34	#     next slice, the AC state and the ruled/unruled decision set. Every one of
    35	#     those facts below is read from it — never re-derived from prose. Change a
    36	#     fact THERE and the manifest follows.
    37	#   * `status:` frontmatter on dev/design/**/*.md (T2c) selects the design tier,
    38	#     so the design-of-record list is derived, not a hardcoded list.
