    44	# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
    45	# T2c's backfill was conservative on purpose: most design docs are UNREVIEWED,
    46	# which means "nobody has classified this yet" — NOT "this is current" — and
    47	# scripts/lint-design-status.sh proves the PRESENCE of a status field, never its
    48	# TRUTH (the classification is a separate owed slice, TC-50). So this manifest
    49	# NEVER presents an UNREVIEWED doc as authoritative: each cited doc carries its
    50	# recorded status inline, UNREVIEWED/UNKNOWN rows are explicitly marked
    51	# unclassified with the TC-50 pointer, and the section header says the status is
