   356	    to the exact content of the allowlist. Briefing the next orchestrator that a
   357	    settled sign-off is still outstanding is how a settled call gets re-decided —
   358	    the failure this whole manifest exists to prevent (see §8: "Ruled decisions
   359	    are CITED, never re-decided or restated").
   360	
   361	    The three facts, kept apart on purpose:
   362	      1. `pre_sign_state` — has the HITL signed off on the CONTENT of the delta?
   363	      2. `minted` / `sign_off_slice` — has the AC been minted and recorded SIGNED?
