   365	      3. `publish_gated_by` — what actually holds publish. Not an unsigned AC.
   366	
   367	    Every required field is read with `[...]`, not `.get(...)`. Under the
   368	    predecessor model a `.get("state_word")` against a state file that no longer
   369	    carried the key printed the literal text `AC-999 — None` and every gate still
   370	    passed: a stale reference rendering a blank is the same defect wearing a
   371	    different hat, so a missing fact dies here instead."""
