   376	                    "`acceptance.publish_gate` carries the RETIRED field `%s`. That single "
   377	                    "collapsed word is what made a Slice-20 manifest brief an already-given "
   378	                    "HITL pre-sign as an outstanding one. Model the facts separately: "
   379	                    "pre_sign_state + pre_sign, minted + minted_as + sign_off_slice, "
   380	                    "publish_gated_by." % retired)
